# Resume Studio — optional site access settings only.
# Copy to .env.local, or configure these names in Vercel Environment Variables.
# All profile, project, resume, ATS history and API settings use browser storage.
# No DATABASE_URL, DATA_FILE or AI environment variables are needed.

# Optional password for opening the app. Leave unset for no site lock.
# APP_PASSWORD=choose-a-strong-password

# Optional signing secret for the login session cookie.
# SESSION_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string

# Configure your provider, API key, URL and model inside the app:
# More → AI Settings → Save on this device.
